cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "DER-SafeAgent: A Runtime-Assurance Architecture for Safe LLM-Assisted Cyber-Physical Incident Response in Distributed Energy Resources"
message: "If you use DER-SafeAgent in academic work, please cite the manuscript and this software repository."
